  partName: Left Valve Cover Gasket
  description: The Left Valve Cover Gasket is a tiny, thin-flat gasket positioned
    at the top-left-center of the engine, sealing the valve cover to prevent oil
    leaks and maintain engine performance. Its small size and thin shape allow it
    to fit snugly between the valve cover and the engine block, ensuring a secure
    seal. Notably, the gasket's material composition helps it to withstand the high
    temperatures and pressures found in this region of the engine.
  audioExplanation: {fileID: 0}
